[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（美音）]
[ti:The Best and the Worst]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]
[00:09.96]Why is Joe's garden | 为什么乔的花园
[00:12.05]the most beautiful one in the town? | 是全镇最漂亮的？
[00:16.92]Joe Sanders has the most beautiful garden | 乔·桑德斯拥有我们镇上
[00:20.67]in our town. | 最漂亮的花园。
[00:22.27]Nearly everybody enters for | 几乎每个人都报名参加
[00:25.17]'The Nicest Garden Competition' each year, | 每年举办的“最佳花园竞赛”，
[00:29.12]but Joe wins every time. | 但每次都是乔获胜。
[00:32.60]Bill Frith's garden is larger than Joe's. | 比尔·弗里斯的花园比乔的花园大。
[00:36.52]Bill works harder than Joe | 比尔比乔更为勤奋，
[00:38.88]and grows more flowers and vegetables, | 种植的花卉和蔬菜也更多，
[00:42.12]but Joe's garden is more interesting. | 但乔的花园更富有情趣。
[00:45.75]He has made neat paths | 他修筑了几条整洁的小路，
[00:47.96]and has built a wooden bridge over a pool. | 还在池塘上架起了一座木桥。
[00:52.25]I like gardens too, | 我也喜欢花园，
[00:54.38]but I do not like hard work. | 但我不喜欢艰苦的劳动。
[00:57.80]Every year | 每年的
[00:59.05]I enter for the garden competition too, | 花园竞赛我也参加，
[01:02.76]and I always win a little prize | 但我总能获得一个小奖，
[01:05.97]for the worst garden in the town! | 因为我是全镇最差花园的得主！
